          "line": 188,
          "kind": "variant",
          "params": [],
          "recursive_group": null,
          "decl": "type destination_form =\n  | DstSum    of stoich_ref list\n  | DstBranch of (stoich_ref * expr) list",
          "doc": "Where a transition sends the individuals it moves.\n\n    {@camdl[\n      infection : S --> I @ beta * S * I / N\n      recovery  : I --> { R : 0.9, D : 0.1 } @ gamma * I\n    ]}\n\n    The two forms:\n    - [DstSum [I]] is a sum of compartments;\n    - [DstBranch] is a probabilistic branch.\n\n    Compare {!Ir.expr}.",
          "members": [
            {
              "name": "DstSum",
              "type": "stoich_ref list",
              "mutable": false,
              "doc": "Every listed compartment gains one individual per firing."
            },
